[I] Logging library

[T] vanessa_logger is a generic logging layer by Simon Horman that allows
[T] logging to syslog, files or file handles through one interface. It is
[T] used by perdition and the other vanessa tools.

[U] https://projects.horms.net/projects/vanessa/

